#78501
"A Cramped Stone Stairway"
"This set of stairs, carved from the rock mountain itself, lead deeper
into the mountain.  No handrail has been constructed; however you can
steady yourself with the rock walls on either side of the stairs. 
Various forms of mold and moss cover most of the rock, even the stairs
have a substantial growth on them.
"
