#78510
"A Room Full of Stone Pillars"
"This area of the cavern has been partitioned off with walls of stone
rubble to the north and south.  A number of tall stone pillars have been
placed in this part of the cavern.  They don't support anything, as you
can see the tops of them quite easily.  Everything is coated in a thick
layer of dust.  Barely visibile under the dust are large patches of a
dark red, almost black, substance on the stone.  A pathway leads out of
this area to the east.
"
