#78511
"An Abandoned Training Area"
"This area of the cavern looks to have been undisturbed for centuries. 
The walls of rubble that partition it off from the rest of the cavern are
covered by a thick layer of dust.  Thick bunches of cobwebs cover parts
of the stone and creep out from various nooks.  A raised stone platform
rests in the middle of the room, also looking to have been untouched for
at least several hundred years.
"
